  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Raixu27/Farm3x3/refs/heads/main/farm3x3-banner-with-icon-halfsize.png\" alt=\"橫幅圖示，旁邊帶有「Farm 3x3」文字\"></p><h1>Farm3x3</h1><p>Farm 3x3 是一個模組，當你手持鋤頭時，會自動收穫 3x3 範圍內的作物。<br>\n如果你在副手持有鋤頭，作物還會自動重新種植。（適用於 Minecraft 1.21+ 及 Farm3x3 2.2.0+ 版本）</p><h2>模組相容性</h2><ul>\n<li>請閱讀<a href=\"https://github.com/Raixu27/Farm3x3/wiki/Supported-Crops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此維基頁面</a>，查看所有支援的原版與模組作物清單。</li>\n<li>為支援特定模組，可能需要額外的資料包，詳情請參閱維基頁面。</li>\n</ul><h2>注意事項</h2><ul>\n<li>若要設定或移除本模組，請執行指令 <code>/function farm3x3:settings</code>。</li>\n<li>本模組在創造模式下無法運作。</li>\n<li>此模組是將資料包重新封裝而成。</li>\n</ul><h2>相關連結</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fcNHrBKWb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/farm-3x3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Raixu27/Farm3x3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/github_64h.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f4RWVg8MgAj\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/farm-3x3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此下載資料包版本</a></p>",
